Posting filters reject an empty account selection.

========== API ==========

postings({ accounts: [''] })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
commodity FUND
account Assets:Cash
account Assets:Fund
account Equity:Opening

2024-01-02 Buy fund  ; imported
  ; Project: Savings
  Assets:Cash  -100 SEK  ; [2024-01-03] card
  Assets:Fund  10 FUND {10 SEK} @ 100 SEK

2024-01-04 Opening balance
  Assets:Cash  20 SEK = 20 SEK
  Equity:Opening

========== ERROR ==========

accounts.0 must be a non-empty string
